# Azure account key. It no longer contains any credential - account name, container,
# account key and SAS are all read from keys.json at runtime (which stays ignored
# above) - so it is tracked as normal source. Verified secret-free before tracking.
# If you ever hardcode a credential in it, move the credential to keys.json instead
